    "result_text": "The full test suite is green \u2014 all 38 tests pass, including the two new `Cp27Tests`.\n\n## Summary\n\nI implemented the `contactPreference` rule: **`EMAIL` when an email is present, otherwise `PHONE`**.\n\nThe `OwnerDto` is generated from the OpenAPI spec at build time and its derived fields (like `membershipLevel`, `locality`) are computed in the MapStruct mapper, so I followed that same pattern:\n\n1. **`src/main/resources/openapi.yml`** \u2014 Added a read-only `contactPreference` property to the `Owner` schema, typed as a string enum of `EMAIL`/`PHONE`. This generates `OwnerDto.ContactPreferenceEnum`.\n\n2. **`src/main/java/.../mapper/OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 Added a `@Mapping` expression on `toOwnerDto` that returns `ContactPreferenceEnum.EMAIL` when the owner's email is non-null and non-empty, otherwise `ContactPreferenceEnum.PHONE` \u2014 consistent with how `membershipLevel` already tests for a present email.",
